  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brazil Reducing Bureaucracy for Faster, More Transparent, and More Economic Procurement in Alagoas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to support to the Government of Alagoas - Brazil by simplifying bidding preparation procedures and improving the AMGESP&apos;s (GoA&apos;s Procurement Agency) capacity to prepare bid cost estimates, a cumbersome and time-consuming step in the preparation of bidding processes.  The proposed project&apos;s development objective is to enhance the efficiency, transparency, and quality of public procurement in the state of Alagoas, Brazil, simplifying bidding preparation procedures and reducing the average bidding preparation times.</narrative>
  </description>
